  Tab             cycle panes       Shift+R         refresh            ,               settings
  t               theme             ]               snippets           ?               help
  Shift+T         tour              Shift+D         sync status        `               jump to workspace
  !               next asking       Shift+F         next failing       .               focus mode
  Shift+W         start agent       Shift+P         activity pane      Shift+Arrows    resize splitters
  q q             quit              Enter           open               w               work on this
  s               shell             e               editor             m               mark read
  z               snooze            Shift+Z         long snooze        Shift+N         new workspace
  n               new workspace     g m             merge PR           g g             auto-merge
  g v | Shift-V   reviewers         g a | Shift-G   assignees          g l | Shift-L   labels
  g o | Shift-O   open in browser   r               reply              Shift+A         adopt sessions
  Shift+J         join into PR      Shift+X         archive            Shift+C         close issue
  c               spawn claude      x               spawn codex        u               spawn cursor
  w c             work in claude    w x             work in codex      w u             work in cursor
  f               filter            o               sort               Shift+S         mailbox
  /               search            Enter           toggle section     →/←             expand/collapse
  g               top               Shift+G         bottom             d               description
  Space           select row        z               undo mark-read     Shift+PgUp/Dn   scroll
  ]]              exit to sidebar   ]]<key>         snippets
